# kick-circles-demo stack

Vanilla only: `index.html` + `styles.css` + `app.js`. No build step, no frameworks, no new deps unless explicitly requested.

## Stream = Living Room (default)

- Default `activeChat = 'stream'`; Stream tab is `active` in HTML
- Living Room feed: `CHAT_STREAM` / `livingRoomChat()` — story, Quiet Validation, dense chat, cues, creator monitor mirror
- Circle tab keeps `CHAT_CIRCLE` as Circles scaffolding only
- Mood tab = Mood Map pane; hide pin/board while Mood is open

## Evolve, don't fork

- Reactions: tap-to-react tray → `S.msgReacts` / `S.myReacts` / `addReaction` / `renderChat`
- Room mood: `reactionLog` + `reactionWindow(ms)` → `roomMood` → shared wash CSS on `.chat-rail`
- Stream mood: simulated beats + Set beat → hints / Follow — not CV/audio ML
- Room Studio: `roomTheme` (tint, accent, glow, wallpaper); Follow default ON
- Quiet Validation: `#chatPin` + `#momentBoard` on Stream above `#chatBody`
- Pulse + wash + hints share one aggregate — never duplicate counts
- State: `KEY = 'kickCircles.v4'` via `load`/`save`; bump key only on breaking schema
- Preserve header ↺ reset and seeded demo chat

## UI patterns

- Kick-dark surfaces; Kick green (`--kick`) for brand; room hues = additive glow over personal Studio base
- Hint chip is non-blocking; click Accept applies theme; never hard-override Studio when Follow is OFF
- Mark Living Room / Stream surfaces with existing `.new-tag`
- Don't bury Pulse only inside live-event tabs; don't expand Mood Map for P0

## Demo hygiene

- Voice is P1 (sim-first if built)
- Story Play switches audience to Stream tab and injects into `CHAT_STREAM`
- Avoid features that break the 2-min script in `PRD-EMOTIONAL-CHAT.md`
- Park Pass/quests/ranks/Circles map work unless the user asks — leave code intact
